// RUN: dxbc-as %s | feme-translate --import-dxsa-bin - | FileCheck %s
//
// The DXBC -> DXIL translation does not cover this shader yet (see
// agent_thoughts.md); until it does, this checks that dxbc-as
// assembles the fxc disassembly and that the dxsa importer decodes
// the result. The reference DXIL is in the .ref file next to this one.
//
// CHECK: dxsa.module

//
// Generated by Microsoft (R) HLSL Shader Compiler 10.1
//
//
// Buffer Definitions: 
